  "faq": {
    "text": "The questions we hear most before a first visit. If yours is not here, write to us — we answer the same day.",
    "items": [
      {
        "question": "How do I prepare for my first visit?",
        "answer": "Arrive ten minutes early to fill in a short questionnaire. Avoid a heavy meal before a massage, and skip exfoliants for two days before a facial."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I move my appointment?",
        "answer": "Yes, free of charge up to 24 hours before, online or by phone. For later cancellations we charge half the price."
      },
      {
        "question": "How long is a gift voucher valid?",
        "answer": "Six months from purchase. The voucher is not tied to a person and can be used by whoever brings it."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I have a massage during pregnancy?",
        "answer": "Yes, from the 14th week, lying on your side and without hot stones. Please mention your pregnancy when booking."
      },
      {
        "question": "Which skincare do you use?",
        "answer": "Natural, mostly vegan skincare from Slovenian and European makers certified by NATRUE. We are happy to show you the ingredient list."
      },
      {
        "question": "Is there parking?",
        "answer": "The nearest car park is on Trnovski pristan, a two-minute walk. For longer appointments we refund up to two hours of parking."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I come with a friend?",
        "answer": "Of course. We have a room for couples massage, and manicures can be done side by side at two tables."
      }
    ]
  },
